# Shipping a Mote version

Pushing `vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH` does **not** build the app. The Release workflow is `workflow_dispatch` only.

After `git tag` + `git push origin vX.Y.Z` (stable), always run:

```sh
gh workflow run Release --field channel=stable --field version=X.Y.Z
gh run watch
```

Do not stop until the GitHub Release for that tag has **`Mote-X.Y.Z.dmg` and `Mote-X.Y.Z.zip`**. The two “Source code” archives GitHub adds to a tag are not a build.

Beta: `channel=beta` and the version is the base semver (the workflow appends `-beta.N`).

Full recipe: [docs/release.md](docs/release.md).
